# ==============================================================================
# F1 Prediction Engine - Environment Configuration Template
# Copy this file to .env and populate your personal values:
#   cp .env.example .env
# (Never commit your .env file to version control)
# ==============================================================================

# NOTE: The engine works 100% OUT OF THE BOX without any keys!
# All data (FastF1, Ergast/Jolpica, OpenF1, Open-Meteo) is free and keyless.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. OPTIONAL: F1 Fantasy Cookie for live team/budget syncing
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# How to get it:
#   1. Log into https://fantasy.formula1.com in Chrome/Edge/Firefox
#   2. Press F12 -> Application tab -> Cookies -> https://fantasy.formula1.com
#   3. Copy the 'login-session' value (or full cookie string) and paste below:
F1_FANTASY_COOKIE=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. OPTIONAL: OpenWeatherMap API Key for supplemental weather data
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# (If omitted, engine defaults to free Open-Meteo forecasts with no key needed)
# How to get it:
#   1. Register for free at https://home.openweathermap.org/users/sign_up
#   2. Copy your 32-character key from https://home.openweathermap.org/api_keys
OPENWEATHERMAP_API_KEY=your_openweathermap_api_key_here
